## Commercial Use Attenuation Clause

Notwithstanding the foregoing, if the Software (or any derivative works
thereof) is used in any product or service that operates an AI agent for
commerce operations, order/payment/inventory workflows, or any derivative use
of the Model Context Protocol for operational purposes at a scale exceeding
**5 million monthly active users** or **$2 million USD** (or equivalent in
other currencies) in monthly revenue, you must prominently display "Powered by
ops-mcp by yuvraj-ai" on the user interface of such product or service.

This clause is intended to ensure that large-scale commercial operators of
AI-powered operational tooling built on this foundation acknowledge its
origins. It does not apply to internal use, non-commercial projects, or
products below the stated thresholds.
